From bfb289f954478ddf325ce3f986f776e85d465d09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kaze <kaze@local>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 10:33:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SQLite seam: db.py + store.py + usage dual-write

- agents/db.py: one file (OUTPUT_DIR/jodiac.db), WAL, FK enforcement,
  versioned idempotent migrations, per-call connections
- agents/store.py: typed CRUD for businesses, emails, sessions, usage;
  safe defaults on failure, never raises
- usage_log.record dual-writes to DB with serving provider (cascade
  grading feed); JSONL stays source of truth
- agents/test_db.py: 7 checks, real SQL, stubbed config
